### C06 · `critical` · shared-global-setting / undeclared exclusive bracket

**Tasks:** `SLT-EML-12`, `SLT-CHK-09`, `SLT-CPN-04`, `SLT-SYN-14`, `SLT-CHK-05`, `SLT-ADM-05`, `SLT-EML-06`

