The early-morning automation exited with code 1 and did not write a substantive report. Its raw artifacts remain at `automation/logs/D03-2026-08-05-early-morning-facts.txt` and `automation/logs/D03-2026-08-05-early-morning-codex.log`. The affected gates are being recovered manually below before later D3 actions.

## SLT-LIFE-04 D3 targeted expiring-soon probe

