- Exact action `14773` (`arraysubs_send_expiring_soon`, args `[12017]`, group `arraysubs-emails`) was scheduled 12 hours ahead and independently re-verified in the browser before execution. Only its authenticated exact-row Admin List Table route was run; no queue drain occurred.
