Task #19: SLT Renewal Price Step: prove the $5 -> $20 crossover lands on renewal #2, not renewal #3
───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  Status:      in-progress
  Priority:    high
  Class:       standard
  Assignee:    --
